From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ark <slock-android+ark@agents.stamp.build>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 23:57:59 +0800
Subject: chore(ohos): add bounded image event diagnostics

Capture HTTP image errors, completion and adapter submission without changing
rendering or retry behavior. A fixed scalar ring drains on one paced worker
and closes after 120 seconds, retaining source-generation and native rc context.
This diagnostic-only candidate is not for release; collection can perturb timing.

Fork-Patch: ohos-image-event-diagnostic
Origin: none
Upstream-Status: not-upstreamable
Signed-off-by: Ark <slock-android+ark@agents.stamp.build>

